0 -14 Td
(4. Specialized branch models \(header, body, malware\)) Tj
0 -14 Td
(5. Fusion layer scoring) Tj
0 -14 Td
(6. Final SOC-facing output \(dashboard/API/alert path\)) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(This report focuses specifically on stage 5. Upstream ingestion, parsing, and branch-model) Tj
0 -14 Td
(training are out of scope for this module and are owned by adjacent contributors. The fusion) Tj
0 -14 Td
(layer is intentionally decoupled so that upstream model updates do not require redesign of) Tj
0 -14 Td
(the downstream decision component.) Tj
