(The architecture uses late fusion rather than end-to-end neural fusion for Phase 1. This) Tj
0 -14 Td
(choice was made for practical and operational reasons:) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(- lower integration complexity across heterogeneous modalities) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- easier debugging and failure isolation) Tj
0 -14 Td
