0 -14 Td
(- `soft_voting.py`: baseline fusion engine) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- `logistic_fusion.py`: trained stacking fusion engine) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- `risk_mapping.py`: score-to-risk conversion logic) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- `loaders.py`: local CSV loading/writing and in-memory dataframe validation) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- `s3_io.py`: cloud I/O helpers for S3 URIs and object read/write) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- `lambda_handler.py`: event-driven Lambda runtime entrypoint) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(This decomposition enables unit-level testing, explainable behavior, and maintainable) Tj
0 -14 Td
(ownership boundaries.) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
