(5.1 Soft Voting \(Baseline\)) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(Soft voting computes the arithmetic mean of available modality probabilities only. Missing) Tj
0 -14 Td
(values are ignored and do not contribute synthetic values to the average.) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(5.2 Logistic Regression Stacking \(Primary\)) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(The stacking model is trained on:) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(- filled probabilities: `p_header_filled`, `p_body_filled`, `p_malware_filled`) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- presence flags: `has_header`, `has_body`, `has_malware`) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- modality count: `models_present_count`) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(This feature design preserves modality-availability information while keeping inference) Tj
0 -14 Td
(stable when values are missing.) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
