0 -14 Td
(----------------------------) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(The model is explicitly designed not to fail when one branch is absent.) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(- Soft voting: excludes missing modalities from mean calculation.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- Logistic stacking: fills missing probabilities with neutral imputation \(`0.50` default\)) Tj
0 -14 Td
(  while preserving true absence via binary indicators.) Tj
